# s2 one-file-two-names: base ({AB}x) from ({AB}x) onto ({AB}y) [strict]
# verdict: ({A B}y)
tree base
/A file x
/B link /A
tree from
/A file x
/B link /A
tree onto
/A file y
/B link /A
expect
#rebase-manifest 4
#base zrt/base@s
#from zrt/from@s
#onto zrt/onto@s
#mode strict
#actions 0
#conflicts 0
/
    ..
